# Repo nay bi sua tu ca hai phia: Windows (editor cua nguoi dung) va Linux
# (container Docker, GitHub API). Khong chot kieu xuong dong thi ca 41 file bao
# "modified" du khong ai doi mot ky tu nao — va moi commit sau do keo theo ca file
# bi viet lai, lam diff 3 dong phinh thanh 200 dong.
#
# text=auto: luon chuan hoa ve LF khi commit.
# eol=lf:    working tree cung dung LF, ke ca tren Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

# File cua Windows thi phai giu CRLF, neu khong cmd.exe doc sai.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Nhi phan: khong dien giai gi.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
